  <revision rev="9" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>903676d8ae9ad9e0059b5cf08205ce7b</srcmd5>
    <version>2.2.4</version>
    <time>1790085154</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 2.2.4:
  * Fix memory leak in _DynamicCapabilityClient._send_helper()
  * Fix SIGSEGV (NULL pointer dereference) on malformed Text field
  * Update default bundled capnproto to 1.4.0
  * Consolidate configurations into pyproject.toml
  * Fix test failures on Python 3.14
  * Revert Data fields to bytes and add get_data_as_view for zero-copy access
  * Fix use-after-free in async write causing corruption with large payloads
  * Make message.to_dict() return bytes for DATA type field
  * Add binary support in dictionaries via base64 encoding
  * Add structure-free read_multiple_bytes_packed
  * Support python custom message builder and make Data field's type return
    MemoryView
  * Add Python 3.13 support
  * Upgrade to Cython version 3
  * Remove usage of deprecated kj::mvCapture functions
  * Make license information SPDX-compatible
  * Generate a new certificate that is compatible with strict x509 checking</comment>
    <requestid>1379578</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
